es is  not worried about the fight but  unbeknownst to him vinny has found out  about his little plan to sabotage a fair  fight he in turn pulls some strengths  and makes sure that billy won't make it  to the school grounds a worried adrian  calls manny and tells him that something  feels off manny has full confidence in  his training and assures her that jimmy  can handle any high school bully school  finally ends for the day and a crowd  gathers outside to witness the fight  billy is on his way to the school when  two people abduct him at vinnie's  request meanwhile miles boasts about how  he is about to beat jimmy to a pulp  knowing that jimmy isn't weak vinnie  encourages him to go one on one with him  the fight starts and initially miles  lands a punch before jimmy but when  jimmy's anger erupts miles is beaten to  the ground everyone is shocked including  the teachers who are watching them from  the staff room's window jimmy tells  miles to never trouble anyone at the  school again before knocking him out  adrian runs to him for a hug as the  crowd erupts into cheers someone uploads  the video of the fight on the internet  and it gains millions of likes people  praise jimmy for standing up against  bullying and it becomes a lesson for  everyone who picks on weaker people for  fun subscribe for more videos like this  turn on notifications and leave a like  to help the channel out thank you for  watching

